/ActualText (Senior Product Designer with 12 years of experience designing fintech and consumer products. I enjoy turning complex problems into experiences that feel simple, intuitive, and ready for production. I care as much about how a product works underneath as how it looks on screen. I work closely with engineering from early discovery through implementation, helping teams make thoughtful product decisions that balance user needs, business goals, and technical constraints.\n\nCurrently based in Jakarta, Indonesia. Open to Senior Product Designer opportunities across Europe, APAC or remote.)
